1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,292
Five things you must never do in
the Dominican Republic.

2
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:05,799
Don't take a street taxi.

3
00:00:05,839 --> 00:00:06,893
Book through your hotel.

4
00:00:07,933 --> 00:00:09,481
Don't leave your drink unattended.

5
00:00:10,521 --> 00:00:12,577
Don't walk alone on empty beaches
at night.

6
00:00:13,617 --> 00:00:15,228
Don't dive into unfamiliar water.

7
00:00:15,268 --> 00:00:16,479
There are few lifeguards.

8
00:00:17,519 --> 00:00:21,120
And don't carry anything for
someone else, not even cannabis.

9
00:00:21,160 --> 00:00:23,568
The country has zero tolerance for
drugs.
